It's something I've observed in virtually every game I play, people have
complained about it in this group and so on. Try picking up a large
quantity of stackable items (40-100 or so) such that there are no more
than say 10 groups initially. When you drop them and pick them up again,
you will end up with less groups on the second pickup period. This is
easily tested, and no, I'm not talking about slash'em in particular
although it probably applies there as well at a guess. My gut tells me
this has to do with the usage of linked lists and stacking, but that is
just a guess. 

